{"3721470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terra-7", "steam_appid": 3721470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7a9f9df56fa5fe46a952bb5f364581fe.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7a9f9df56fa5fe46a952bb5f364581fe.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7a9f9df56fa5fe46a952bb5f364581fe.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the alien world of <strong>Terra-7</strong>, grow a small pioneering outpost into a sprawling company. In order to be successful, you will need to learn how to balance revenue generation with the well-being of the workforce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/57a225a635b82a9cc6e970f6a69a893f.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/57a225a635b82a9cc6e970f6a69a893f.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/57a225a635b82a9cc6e970f6a69a893f.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire</strong> workers to extract valuable alien minerals, <strong>process</strong> them into goods, and <strong>build</strong> increasingly complex production chains. Manage <strong>work shifts</strong>, expand your base, and tend to the needs of a growing colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your employees, however, are not just &quot;human resources.&quot; They are people with real needs like <strong>hunger</strong> and <strong>sleep</strong>, and their <strong>stress</strong> levels are influenced by overwork and business growth. There is more than one strategy to keep things under control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/5307a4b98a80ad9ff7aa3a89d4c44893.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/5307a4b98a80ad9ff7aa3a89d4c44893.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/5307a4b98a80ad9ff7aa3a89d4c44893.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each cycle, you must undergo a <strong>Performance Review</strong>. Five Company Investors will evaluate your performance. Each of them has a different set of priorities. Some reward expansion and research, others focus on employees welfare, and a few might only care about dividends. To keep the colony running, you must satisfy at least three investors every cycle. Lose their trust completely, and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7ed0c846dac2d8808e1c3316e260b8e1.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7ed0c846dac2d8808e1c3316e260b8e1.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7ed0c846dac2d8808e1c3316e260b8e1.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complicate matters, the alien flora will react to your expansion, releasing spores to defend its planet. You'll need to find ways to keep your employees safe and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your employees come first</strong> — Employees must eat, sleep, and manage stress from overwork, alien flora attacks, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer to the Investors</strong> — Every cycle ends with a review from Company Investors, whose decisions can reward — or punish — how you've run things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural biomes</strong> — Every map is procedurally generated, with multiple biomes planned for the full release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> — a clean UI and a limited set of Resources to keep the challenge in the decisions, not in parsing the screen.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7a9f9df56fa5fe46a952bb5f364581fe.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7a9f9df56fa5fe46a952bb5f364581fe.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7a9f9df56fa5fe46a952bb5f364581fe.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the alien world of <strong>Terra-7</strong>, grow a small pioneering outpost into a sprawling company. In order to be successful, you will need to learn how to balance revenue generation with the well-being of the workforce.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/57a225a635b82a9cc6e970f6a69a893f.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/57a225a635b82a9cc6e970f6a69a893f.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/57a225a635b82a9cc6e970f6a69a893f.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hire</strong> workers to extract valuable alien minerals, <strong>process</strong> them into goods, and <strong>build</strong> increasingly complex production chains. Manage <strong>work shifts</strong>, expand your base, and tend to the needs of a growing colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your employees, however, are not just &quot;human resources.&quot; They are people with real needs like <strong>hunger</strong> and <strong>sleep</strong>, and their <strong>stress</strong> levels are influenced by overwork and business growth. There is more than one strategy to keep things under control. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/5307a4b98a80ad9ff7aa3a89d4c44893.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/5307a4b98a80ad9ff7aa3a89d4c44893.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/5307a4b98a80ad9ff7aa3a89d4c44893.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each cycle, you must undergo a <strong>Performance Review</strong>. Five Company Investors will evaluate your performance. Each of them has a different set of priorities. Some reward expansion and research, others focus on employees welfare, and a few might only care about dividends. To keep the colony running, you must satisfy at least three investors every cycle. Lose their trust completely, and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7ed0c846dac2d8808e1c3316e260b8e1.poster.avif?t=1787647032\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7ed0c846dac2d8808e1c3316e260b8e1.webm?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/extras/7ed0c846dac2d8808e1c3316e260b8e1.mp4?t=1787647032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To complicate matters, the alien flora will react to your expansion, releasing spores to defend its planet. You'll need to find ways to keep your employees safe and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your employees come first</strong> — Employees must eat, sleep, and manage stress from overwork, alien flora attacks, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer to the Investors</strong> — Every cycle ends with a review from Company Investors, whose decisions can reward — or punish — how you've run things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural biomes</strong> — Every map is procedurally generated, with multiple biomes planned for the full release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> — a clean UI and a limited set of Resources to keep the challenge in the decisions, not in parsing the screen.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A Business Colony Sim where you build your company on a hostile alien world. Keep your employees happy. Bring results—and profits—to investors. All at the same time!", "supported_languages": "English, Italian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/40e060c9a22202edad08e29fbff11809cd83fbff/header.jpg?t=1787647032", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/5d406fb480764588f37720f63bc750e7589ddd3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787647032", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721470/5d406fb480764588f37720f63bc750e7589ddd3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787647032", "website": "https://gamyeonstudio.com/terra7", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon R7 260X or Geforce GT 730<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_u